# byte-exact golden corpus. (Plan: docs/plans/07-reference-configs.md §8.)
# The handle below is the current single owner; broaden/extend on second-maintainer
# onboarding (the documented bus-factor accommodation — docs/plans/00-overview.md Open Question 6).
